The frontend build (frontend/dist, produced by `npm run build`) copies the
following third-party runtime assets from the pdf.js distribution
(pdfjs-dist, Apache-2.0, https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js) into
dist/assets/pdfjs/. Each directory ships its own license text, reproduced
here by reference:

- cmaps/          Adobe CMap resources. Copyright 1990-2009 Adobe Systems
                  Incorporated. BSD-style license (cmaps/LICENSE).
- standard_fonts/ Foxit standard fonts. Copyright 2014 PDFium Authors.
                  BSD-3-Clause (standard_fonts/LICENSE_FOXIT).
                  Liberation fonts. Copyright 2012 Red Hat, Inc. and
                  Google Corporation. SIL Open Font License 1.1
                  (standard_fonts/LICENSE_LIBERATION).
- wasm/           OpenJPEG. BSD-2-Clause (wasm/LICENSE_OPENJPEG,
                  wasm/LICENSE_PDFJS_OPENJPEG).
                  qcms. Copyright 2009-2024 Mozilla Corporation,
                  1998-2007 Marti Maria. MIT (wasm/LICENSE_QCMS,
                  wasm/LICENSE_PDFJS_QCMS).
- iccs/           ICC profiles. CC0 1.0 Universal (iccs/LICENSE).

script-runner-seccomp-fallback.json is a snapshot of the default seccomp
profile from containers/common (https://github.com/containers/common),
Apache-2.0.

The JetBrains Mono typeface is loaded at runtime from Google Fonts and is
not distributed with this product (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
